  <div class="hustle-card">
    <h3 id="bike-repair">12. Bike tune-ups and repair</h3>
    <p>Minneapolis is one of the best biking cities in the country, with the Grand Rounds and the Midtown Greenway packed from April on. Spring tune-ups from a driveway or a mobile setup are a strong niche, and winter fat-bike riders keep a few clients coming year-round.</p>
    <ul class="meta"><li><b>Pay:</b> $50–$120 per tune-up</li><li><b>Startup:</b> $150–$400 in tools</li><li><b>Best for:</b> Cyclists who wrench</li></ul>
  </div>
