    <p>Hosts near downtown, the University and the stadiums need fast turnovers on game weekends and during big conventions. Co-hosting for owners who live out of town pays a share of revenue. Minneapolis requires short-term rentals to be licensed, so make sure the owner is compliant.</p>
    <ul class="meta"><li><b>Pay:</b> $25–$45/hr cleaning; 15–25% as co-host</li><li><b>Startup:</b> $75–$150 in supplies</li><li><b>Best for:</b> Detail-oriented organizers</li></ul>
  </div>
